20. Date and Time Functions

First convert the column:

df["Date"] = pd.to_datetime(df["Date"])

===

Then:

| Method              | Use                     | Example                       |
| ------------------- | ----------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| `.dt.year`          | Get year                | `df["Date"].dt.year`          |
| `.dt.month`         | Get month               | `df["Date"].dt.month`         |
| `.dt.day`           | Get day                 | `df["Date"].dt.day`           |
| `.dt.hour`          | Get hour                | `df["Date"].dt.hour`          |
| `.dt.minute`        | Get minute              | `df["Date"].dt.minute`        |
| `.dt.day_name()`    | Get weekday name        | `df["Date"].dt.day_name()`    |
| `.dt.month_name()`  | Get month name          | `df["Date"].dt.month_name()`  |
| `.dt.weekday`       | Get weekday number      | `df["Date"].dt.weekday`       |
| `.dt.days_in_month` | Number of days in month | `df["Date"].dt.days_in_month` |
